WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.2 · Internal Systems & Operations
Minimum viable systems by stage

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Start with the smallest systems your risks need, and add more at clear triggers.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Keep each system as simple as its risk allows.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Write down the events that trigger new systems.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Drop tools and records nobody uses.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“WhatsApp, a shared Drive, a notebook cash book, paper consent forms. A bank account with two signatories once registered.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your minimum systems now and the triggers for more.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
